# The input embedded and one of its fields overwritten with a constant.
-- source.cue --
a: int
-- target.cue --
a: int
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {input, a: 5}
-- out --
not total
result.a is written as 5 and as input.a (through input), and the two unify, so one may reject the other's value; write the field once (rule write-conflict) @ lens.cue:2:10
